  "summary": "The SitePro 050S GPS antenna tripod, ideal for GNSS, GPS, and\nmachine-control applications, features rugged aluminum construction\nwith dual-lock extendable tripod legs, fine adjustment, and a collapsible\n2-meter center staff.",
  "specs": [
    "Collapsible center staff rotates 360° to check calibration of the plumb",
    "Dual graduations with positive locking pin adjust to three standard heights: 2.0 m, 1.8 m, and 1.5 m",
    "Collapses to 50 inches (127 cm)",
    "Integrated fine adjustment enables quick, precise leveling adjustments without having to reset leg clamps",
    "Dual-locking tripod legs feature both quick-release levers and secondary twist-lock mechanisms for maximum stability and speed in the field",
    "Lightweight, heavy-duty aluminum legs and staff are electrostatically powder-coated in standard yellow",
    "Anodized black aluminum hardware for long wear life and corrosion resistance",
    "Removable 5/8-11 threaded head adapter accepts standard GNSS antennas and surveying instruments",
    "Replaceable points on tripod feet and center staff",
    "Large attachable soft-turf spurs (included) provide extra grip and stability on soft ground to prevent twisting"
